{"title":"Unlit Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003eEverything You Need to Know About Unlit Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our unlit artificial Christmas trees designed to give you complete control over your holiday decorating. Here at King of Christmas, our unlit trees combine lifelike foliage, natural color variation, and exceptional craftsmanship to create a beautiful foundation for your holiday display, just without the built-in lights. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eEach unlit artificial Christmas tree is available in a variety of sizes and silhouettes, making it easy to customize your lighting style. Whether you prefer warm white string lights, colorful displays, or a minimalist look, unlit trees allow you to bring your vision to life. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eShop our collection of unlit artificial Christmas trees to find a high-quality tree designed for flexibility, creativity, and long-lasting use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy Choose an Unlit Christmas Tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eUnlit artificial Christmas trees are ideal for those who want flexibility and creative freedom when decorating. Without pre-installed lights, you can choose the exact type, color, and arrangement of lighting that best suits your style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThey’re also a great option for long-term use, as you can refresh your lighting each season without having to replace the entire tree. Many customers also appreciate the simplicity of unlit trees, especially if they already have a preferred lighting setup or enjoy the tradition of decorating from scratch.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow many lights should you put on an unlit Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe number of lights you need for an unlit Christmas tree depends on the height of your tree and your desired level of brightness. A common guideline is to use approximately 100 lights per foot of tree height for a classic look.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIf you prefer a more illuminated or layered look, you can increase this amount depending on your style preference. Ultimately, the key benefit of an unlit Christmas tree is the ability to fully customize your lighting, whether you prefer a subtle glow or a more radiant look. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow do you add lights to an unlit tree?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe first step in decorating an unlit Christmas tree is adding the lights and this should always be done before any ornaments or décor. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eBegin at the bottom of the tree, starting with the widest branches, and work your way upward in sections. Fully wrap each layer around the tree before moving up to the middle and top sections to ensure even coverage.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAs you string the lights, weave them from the inside of the tree out toward the tips of the branches, then back toward the trunk before continuing around. This in-and-out technique helps distribute light more evenly throughout the tree, creating depth and a balanced glow from the inside out.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePro tip: keep the lights turned on as you decorate. This allows you to see how the tree is illuminated in real time and adjust placement as needed to avoid dark spots or overly bright areas.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eUnlit vs. Pre-Lit Christmas Trees: Which Is Better?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChoosing between an unlit and pre-lit Christmas tree comes down to personal preference, decorating style, and convenience. \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre-lit artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e are designed for ease and consistency, featuring professionally installed lights that create a balanced, evenly lit look right out of the box. Many pre-lit trees are available in \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ewarm white\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/multicolor-pre-lit-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Multicolor Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003emulti-color\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e, and more advanced lighting styles, making them a great choice for those who want a polished look with minimal setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eUnlit artificial Christmas trees, on the other hand, offer more flexibility and creative control. You can choose your own lights, customize placement, and change your lighting style from year to year. This makes unlit trees a popular option for those who enjoy decorating from scratch or prefer a more personalized approach to their holiday display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe best choice depends on how you prefer to decorate and what matters most to you.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you prefer a fully customized lighting design or enjoy the tradition of decorating from scratch, unlit artificial Christmas trees offer flexibility, creativity, and long-lasting value. Explore our collection to find an unlit Christmas tree that provides the perfect foundation for your holiday décor year after year.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb id=\"docs-internal-guid-138602cc-7fff-11aa-5ce6-615a8cdbfbcf\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642896805952,"sku":"QF-T6.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5_67d3c5cc-8f63-4646-82b6-ac5667cde3ad.jpg?v=1718158334"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","descrip